abstract: "Open B2B RAG and regulatory knowledge dataset covering Swedish market entry strategy, corporate law (Aktiebolag/Bolagsverket), K2/K3 statutory accounting, tax and VAT compliance (Skatteverket), employment and labor law (LAS), customs and import/export regulations (Tullverket), and localization. Curated and maintained by CE Sweden (https://www.ce.se/)."
